433→- Evidence REQUIRED for scores >= 75. Cite specific resume content.
434→- Be honest and precise. Avoid clustering around 50.
435→
436→CRITICAL MUST-HAVES (missing ANY = hard_fit false): ${criticalMustHaves || "None specified"}
437→PREFERRED MUST-HAVES (missing = penalty only): ${preferredMustHaves || "None specified"}
