447→- matched_preferred_must_haves: string[]
448→- missing_preferred_must_haves: string[]
449→- category_scores: object where each key is a dimension key, value is {score: 0-100, evidence: [{snippet: string, section: string}], notes: string}
450→- strengths: string[] (all notable strengths for this specific role — include as many as the resume supports, no fixed limit)
451→- gaps: string[] (all notable gaps/weaknesses for this specific role — include as many as are relevant, no fixed limit)
